                        <item_1749712312377
                            cq:panelTitle="AbbVie Business Code of Conduct"
                            cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-01-23T03:34:57.818-05:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>Our code describes our commitment to the people we serve: patients, healthcare providers, shareholders, business partners and our fellow employees. View our Code of Business Conduct &lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/uk/documents/UK-ABBV-250208-EXAM-abbvie-code-of-business-conduct-no-links.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>here&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
                        <item_1749712320625
                            cq:panelTitle="AbbVie Supplier Code of Conduct "
                            cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2025-07-16T06:51:04.841-04:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>The AbbVie Supplier Code of Conduct documents the principles, guidelines, and expectations for establishing and maintaining a business relationship with AbbVie. View our Supplier Code of Conduct &lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/uk/documents/UK-ABBV-250210-%20supplier-code-of-conduct-july-2025.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>here&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
                        <item_1749712327444
                            cq:panelTitle="Commitment to Human Rights "
                            cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2025-07-16T06:47:02.427-04:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>AbbVie believes in the inherent dignity of every human being and respects individual rights as set out in the Universal Declaration of Human Rights. We reflect these precepts in our company’s fundamental principles and in our mission to address serious health challenges.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;We contribute to the realisation of human rights through our policies on employment, ethics and procurement. Our practices and programs not only ensure compliance with laws and regulations wherever we have operations, but also address any workplace concerns raised by employees. &lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/uk/documents/UK-ABBV-2502-commitment-to-human-rights-13-july-2025.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Read our commitment&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
                        <item_1749712332243
                            cq:panelTitle="Modern Slavery Statement"
                            cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-01-23T03:43:22.727-05:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>Our Modern Slavery Act Transparency Statement can found &lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/uk/documents/uk-abbv-250209-modern-slavery.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>here&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
                        <item_1749712337009
                            cq:panelTitle="AbbVie Ltd. Board of Directors S.172 Statement "
                            cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-01-23T04:53:22.753-05:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>A Signed PDF version of the S172 Financial Statement from year ending December 2024 can be found &lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/uk/documents/S172-directors-statement.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>here&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
                        <item_1749712344386
                            cq:panelTitle="Pension Fund"
                            cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-01-23T05:06:59.677-05:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>AbbVie’s Pension Fund Statement of Investment Principles can be viewed &lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/uk/documents/abbVie-pension-fund-statement-of-investment.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>here&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>AbbVie’s Pension Fund Engagement Policy Implementation Statement can be viewed &lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/uk/documents/EXAM-abbVie-co-uk-engagement-policy-implementation-statement-december-2024.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>here&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
